    <LoadingProgress.StartupImpact.ScaleDetail.Tip>Impact values below this amount of time are shown close to their true proportions; values above it get compressed more heavily so a single very slow mod does not drown out the rest of the bar. Lower this to make small differences between fast mods easier to see; raise it to keep large impacts looking proportionally larger.</LoadingProgress.StartupImpact.ScaleDetail.Tip>
